Go to first line in file: g
Go to last line in file: G
Forward one window: z
Forward one line: e
Backward one line: y
Search forward for matching line: /что ищем вперед
Search backward for matching line: ?что ищем назад
Repeat previous search: n
Repeat previous search in reverse direction: N


